---
// The 3 steps to a running RackDesk.
import InstallCommand from './InstallCommand.astro'
---

<section class="band" id="install">
  <div class="glow">
    <h2>Running in 3 steps.</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>
        <h3>Run the installer on the server</h3>
        <InstallCommand id="install-cmd-2" />
      </li>
      <li><h3>Open it in a browser</h3><p>The installer prints the address and the admin password. Reach the port the way you already reach the server: local network, reverse proxy, SSH forward, VPN or tunnel.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Set your own password</h3><p>RackDesk asks for it at the first sign-in. After that the desktop opens.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
